  "description": "E-Yan is a Korean songwriter who has been struggling with a slump. Despite wanting to write love songs, he can't force himself to. Due to his job, E-Yan starts working with the hottest rising star in the K-hiphop industry, Cha Hyun-Ho, who is famous for writing psycho songs despite being a good person in real life. Though he catches E-Yan's eye, E-Yan forces himself to brush off his growing feelings for Hyun-Ho, for the sake of both of their careers, but, because they're signed on the same label, E-Yan and Hyun-Ho keep ending up together...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
